{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a high-speed retro first-person shooter that combines the hardcore action of Hotline Miami, the high-tech Soviet setting of Atomic Heart, and Dusk's intense gunplay. Every move is your chance to survive, every stop is a ticket to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, you learn to be more precise, faster, and more careful. The stakes are high - a single hit can bring death to either you or the enemy. Take advantage of all your mobility in order to become part of this endless dance with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival relies heavily on firearms, and sometimes you come across weapons of great power. But remember - each bullet is a valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action unfolds in an alternate 1990s version of USSR. The city of Mirnogorsk is located in the depths of Khakassia, a city that is the pride of the Union, a center of innovation and progress. The high-tech facilities of this city embodied the vision and hopes for a bright future of every citizen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, a tragic accident turned the pride of the Soviet Union into chaos, bringing the protagonist, Sergei, into the center of it. A mere utility worker with a challenging fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and meaty gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with branching paths where the choice can affect the walkthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large arsenal of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack combining techno, hard bass, and breakcore.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499560?t=1757604015","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757604015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/4cdc926d0b6fc67b072591f1583d52f2350380b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757604015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/4cdc926d0b6fc67b072591f1583d52f2350380b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757604015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Graphic depictions of violence such as decapitations, severed limbs, exploding bodies. Alcohol, profanity."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>CLAIM YOUR GOLD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/38817ca938c355d2e5c7d7493488b03a.poster.avif?t=1757604015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/38817ca938c355d2e5c7d7493488b03a.webm?t=1757604015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/38817ca938c355d2e5c7d7493488b03a.mp4?t=1757604015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMUR is a high-speed retro first-person shooter that combines the hardcore action of Hotline Miami, the high-tech Soviet setting of Atomic Heart, and Dusk's intense gunplay. Every move is your chance to survive, every stop is a ticket to oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life, endless attempts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, you learn to be more precise, faster, and more careful. The stakes are high - a single hit can bring death to either you or the enemy. Take advantage of all your mobility in order to become part of this endless dance with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival relies heavily on firearms, and sometimes you come across weapons of great power. But remember - each bullet is a valuable resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are non-linear structures in which choosing a path directly impacts the flow of the game. Having trouble with one path? Pick another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world will speak if you are ready to listen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interested in finding out what's going on? Learn more about the facility and its destruction by exploring levels, finding clues, audio recordings, and other details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action unfolds in an alternate 1990s version of USSR. The city of Mirnogorsk is located in the depths of Khakassia, a city that is the pride of the Union, a center of innovation and progress. The high-tech facilities of this city embodied the vision and hopes for a bright future of every citizen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, a tragic accident turned the pride of the Soviet Union into chaos, bringing the protagonist, Sergei, into the center of it. A mere utility worker with a challenging fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/extras/3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1757604015\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and meaty gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with branching paths where the choice can affect the walkthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large arsenal of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack combining techno, hard bass, and breakcore.</p></li></ul>","developers":["FoxusSexus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499560/2b7b2003e052f1a88d9fc6179a74510d67e8232b/header.jpg?t=1757604015","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257179014,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179014/movie480.mp4?t=1754485240","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179014/movie_max.mp4?t=1754485240"},"name":"HMUR Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179014/2dbd295e1c1321e9e1866c2b5359cb0ee1e6d13f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754485240","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179014/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754485240","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179014/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754485240"}}],"name":"HMUR","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX 6350 / Intel i3 4150<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel i5-8400<br></li><li